A definition between two open content columns reaches the outer one

```
- - x
  [r]: /url

See [r][].
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>x</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>See <a href="/url">r</a>.</p>
```

